{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Check Coding Guidelines",
  "description": "Reminds the agent to verify code changes follow project guidelines before writing files",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "preToolUse",
    "toolTypes": [
      "write"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Before writing this code, verify it follows ALL guidelines in .ai/steering/project-guidelines.md and .ai/steering/CRITICAL-RULES-CHECKLIST.md:\n- Queries ONLY in repositories (never in services)\n- Repositories extend src/common/repositories/base.repository.ts; no @InjectRepository(Entity)\n- Use @ path aliases for 2+ directories back\n- DTOs (class-validator) for every request input\n- Enums/constants instead of magic values\n- ConfigService instead of process.env; never log secrets\n- Max 1 blank line before/after functions\n- Unit tests in the module's __tests__ folder\n\nIf the code violates any guideline, STOP and fix it first."
  }
}
